# Keep these
!.codebuddy/
!.codebuddy/**

# NOTE: 上面的 !.codebuddy/** 会重新包含所有被忽略文件，以下规则必须放在它之后覆盖
# Re-ignore build artifacts inside .codebuddy (must stay AFTER !.codebuddy/**)
.codebuddy/**/__pycache__/
.codebuddy/**/*.pyc
.codebuddy/**/*.pyo
.codebuddy/**/*.log
